1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,920
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) He takes out a pen.

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,780
He takes off the cap.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,060
He drops it.

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,400
He looks down.

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,480
He does not see the cap.

6
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,460
He looks around his desk.

7
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:19,220
He still does not see the cap.

8
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,620
Where could it be?

9
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,180
He has to find it.

10
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:28,120
The pen will dry out without the cap.

11
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:31,240
He goes to the other side of the

12
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:31,560
room.

13
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,620
He sees the cap.
